{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
BUNDLE PRICE
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

For starter / player packs and audiobook bundles, the compare-at price is the "sum of the components". Instead of a plain
strikethrough, this snippet uses it to emphasise what the shopper saves by buying the bundle:

  price card:   £79.99  [saves 21%]
                Bought separately £100.96
  badge:        [box icon] Bundle saves £20.97

Outputs NOTHING unless the product type is listed in settings.bundle_product_types and the (cheapest / given) variant
has a compare-at price above its price, so callers can fall back to their existing price rendering.

Layout note: the "bought separately" line is absolutely positioned (see voxblock.css) so it never changes card height.

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* product: the product (or pass a variant and the product is read from it)
* variant: optional. If omitted the cheapest variant is used (product cards)
* part: "price" (default) | "badge" | "saving" (just the formatted amount saved) | "is_bundle" (outputs "true" if the
  product type is a bundle type, whatever its prices)
* form_id: product page only. If set (together with variant), the output is a <bundle-price> element that updates when
  the variant changes. It renders when any variant has a saving, hiding the chip/caption while the selected one has none
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign bundle_product = product | default: variant.product
  assign bundle_ok = false
  assign bundle_type_ok = false

  if settings.bundle_pricing_enabled and bundle_product.type != blank
    assign bundle_type_key = bundle_product.type | strip | downcase
    assign bundle_types = settings.bundle_product_types | downcase | split: ','
    for bundle_type in bundle_types
      assign bundle_type_check = bundle_type | strip
      if bundle_type_check == bundle_type_key
        assign bundle_type_ok = true
      endif
    endfor
  endif

  if bundle_type_ok
    assign bundle_variant = variant
    if bundle_variant == blank
      assign bundle_variant = bundle_product.variants | sort: 'price' | first
    endif
    if bundle_variant.compare_at_price > bundle_variant.price
      assign bundle_ok = true
      assign bundle_saving = bundle_variant.compare_at_price | minus: bundle_variant.price
    elsif form_id != blank
      comment
        Product page: the selected variant has no saving, but another variant may, so keep the element (hidden parts)
      endcomment
      for other_variant in bundle_product.variants
        if other_variant.compare_at_price > other_variant.price
          assign bundle_ok = true
        endif
      endfor
      assign bundle_saving = 0
    endif
  endif
-%}

{%- if part == 'is_bundle' -%}
  {%- if bundle_type_ok -%}true{%- endif -%}
{%- elsif bundle_ok -%}
  {%- if part == 'saving' -%}
    {%- if bundle_saving > 0 -%}{{- bundle_saving | money -}}{%- endif -%}
  {%- elsif part == 'badge' -%}
    <span class="badge badge--bundle">
      {%- render 'icon' with 'picto-box', width: 16, height: 16 -%}
      {%- assign bundle_saving_badge = bundle_saving | money -%}
      <span>{{ 'product.bundle.saves_badge' | t: amount: bundle_saving_badge }}</span>
    </span>
  {%- else -%}
    {%- assign bundle_has_saving = false -%}
    {%- assign bundle_saving_pct = 0 -%}
    {%- if bundle_saving > 0 -%}
      {%- assign bundle_has_saving = true -%}
      {%- assign bundle_saving_pct = bundle_saving | times: 100.0 | divided_by: bundle_variant.compare_at_price | round -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- capture bundle_price_html -%}{%- if settings.currency_code_enabled -%}{{- bundle_variant.price | money_with_currency -}}{%- else -%}{{- bundle_variant.price | money -}}{%- endif -%}{%- endcapture -%}
    {%- capture bundle_compare_html -%}{%- if settings.currency_code_enabled -%}{{- bundle_variant.compare_at_price | money_with_currency -}}{%- else -%}{{- bundle_variant.compare_at_price | money -}}{%- endif -%}{%- endcapture -%}

    {%- if form_id != blank -%}
      {%- comment -%}PRODUCT PAGE: normal flow (no height constraint), updated on variant change by assets/voxblock.js{%- endcomment -%}
      <bundle-price form="{{ form_id }}" chip-template="{{ 'product.bundle.saves_chip' | t: percent: '__PERCENT__' | escape }}" was-template="{{ 'product.bundle.bought_separately' | t: price: '__PRICE__' | escape }}" class="bundle-price bundle-price--page">
        <span class="bundle-price__now text-lg" data-bundle-now>
          <span class="sr-only">{{ 'product.price.sale_price' | t }}</span>
          {{- bundle_price_html -}}
        </span>
        <span class="bundle-price__chip" data-bundle-chip {% unless bundle_has_saving %}hidden{% endunless %}>{{ 'product.bundle.saves_chip' | t: percent: bundle_saving_pct }}</span>
        <span class="bundle-price__was" data-bundle-was {% unless bundle_has_saving %}hidden{% endunless %}>{{ 'product.bundle.bought_separately' | t: price: bundle_compare_html }}</span>
      </bundle-price>
    {%- else -%}
      {%- comment -%}PRODUCT CARD: the "bought separately" line is absolutely positioned so card height never changes{%- endcomment -%}
      <span class="bundle-price">
        <span class="bundle-price__now text-lg {% if bundle_product.price_varies and variant == blank %}from-price{% endif %}">
          <span class="sr-only">{{ 'product.price.sale_price' | t }}</span>
          {{- bundle_price_html -}}
        </span>
        <span class="bundle-price__chip">{{ 'product.bundle.saves_chip' | t: percent: bundle_saving_pct }}</span>
        <span class="bundle-price__was">
          <span class="bundle-price__was-long">{{ 'product.bundle.bought_separately' | t: price: bundle_compare_html }}</span>
          <span class="bundle-price__was-short">{{ 'product.bundle.worth' | t: price: bundle_compare_html }}</span>
        </span>
      </span>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
